WEBVTT

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:10.300
Is the coast clear?

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.420
I don't see any bugs for now.

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.470
But I don't think
there's any water either.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:17.220
Munch, munch.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.100
I can taste the place I'm at this way.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.560
Really?

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.600
Wow, you really can taste it! That's cool.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.230
The landscape has changed a little.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.150
Yeah, we just passed a wall.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.740
This is Island Three.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.490
Oh no, I missed the wall!

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.280
You play with the Kemurikusa too much.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.500
Where are we going to head to
at Island Three?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.500
I want to cross Sky Bridge
to get to Island Four.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.710
So we're going to head for Sky Bridge.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.920
Rina hardly knows anything
about beyond Island Four.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.010
-Rina can't wait.
-To the lake!

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.930
Actually Rina,
you've gone to Island Five before.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.810
When Rina was one person?

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:03.560
-Rina doesn't remember.
-It's all new.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:11.400
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:18.280
Long night will continue on

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:21.830
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.160
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:45.020
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:51.400
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:58.450
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:06.290
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:13.380
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:20.550
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:26.930
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.600
Endless agony

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:34.110
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.440
You've been touching that forever.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.360
You really like that.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:43.200
This Kemurikusa that Ritsu-san gave me.
It's so pretty.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.410
What's so great about it?

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:49.710
Wakaba, did you figure out how to use it?

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:52.880
I think I'm getting somewhere
with the blue one.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.170
See, watch this.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.420
It responds to my movements.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.800
These leaf veins. Isn't it pretty?

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.260
Ritsu-san's orange one
glowed for a second too.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.480
I wonder what triggers it.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:11.440
Ahh, it's totally interesting!

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:14.480
-But you can't eat it.
-You're crazy.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.070
Kemurikusa crazy.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.320
No, this is really amazing.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:22.450
It's not just pretty,
but people must've used this long ago.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.910
So if I figure this one out,
I might understand how to use the others.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.200
You talk too fast for Rina-chan.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.830
I don't get it at all.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.290
Can Rina bite it?

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.080
Of course not!

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.920
Fine then.
Because Rina has a special one too.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.680
So pretty! So huge!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.300
-It's Momo-chan.
-Yup.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:48.600
This is how Rina-chan duplicates.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:52.890
Huh? How did you do that?
That's incredible.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:56.270
See what else Rina can do.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.830
That's so cute!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.870
Munch!

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:18.670
That is so interesting.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.630
We can do even more if we feel like it.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.510
Yeah, lots more.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:27.760
That's why we have to eat
a lot of new different things.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:31.060
We'll find more foods we like,
so it'll be great.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:35.560
And once there's lots of Rina-chans,
it'll make it easier for our sisters.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.520
Got it, Wakaba?

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.480
That's so interesting.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:44.450
That's how you use it, huh?
It's so pretty.

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:46.570
I want to see!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:50.120
-No more!
-Bring something tasty if you want to see.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.580
That's right!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.460
How about that one?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.540
Uh-uh. No good.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.210
You don't get it.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.340
Quiet.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:00.750
Oh, Sis is getting angry!

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.460
Hide, hide!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:13.600
I can't see very far from here.
We should go slowly.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.350
I sense a few small ones.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:18.900
-Where?
-They're coming up.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:27.820
-Up ahead.
-Okay.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:39.710
Those are the only ones.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.250
Okay, I'm going in.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:58.560
-You did it!
-All right!

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:01.310
Wow, that was quick.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.530
Great work. You really are amazing.

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.240
Good job, Sis Rin.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.830
That's Midori-san, right?

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.500
So this color is poisonous for Red Bugs.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:19.670
Wow, you didn't miss a beat
using this leaf.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:25.800
I-It's nothing compared to Ryo.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:31.300
Rin is really talented.
I'm so proud of her.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:35.020
-And Rina-chan's here too.
-We're undefeatable.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:37.980
So there are Red Bugs on this island too.

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.020
They're always after us.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.770
What's with them?

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:46.780
That's a regular one, so it's no big deal.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:50.070
The one at Island One
was a big one, wasn't it?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.990
I don't ever want to see one again.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.330
Not a chance, Wakaba.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.410
There's an even bigger, stronger one.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.710
It's Nushi.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:06.420
So, what do you do if you come across it?
This Nushi bug?

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.050
We run.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:15.390
It's that dangerous? Oh, it's hopeless!

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:19.390
Tut-tut. Ryo-chan beat one once before.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.270
Huh? How?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.980
Rina doesn't remember.

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:24.150
Aww, come on.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.320
Okay, off we go.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:29.860
There isn't any new food here.
It's boring.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.330
Rina-san really is peculiar.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:43.830
Wakaba-kun, could you not talk about Nushi
when Rin's around?

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:49.710
Sure, okay.
I don't want to think about it either.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.130
Well, yes.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.340
She's kind of sensitive about it.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:56.300
I see...

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.980
We got pretty far today.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:08.650
You overdid it, Sis.

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.700
I'm fine. Better to keep a move on.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.660
We'll get to the wall soon tomorrow.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.200
Sky Bridge.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.660
We can't see what's under the bridge.

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.870
We should cross it quickly.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:27.090
You're right. There won't be any bugs
on Sky Bridge.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.760
Everybody rest well for tonight.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:37.930
How is it going, Wakaba-kun?
Think you can use it?

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.470
I'm not sure how quite yet.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.180
But they're even prettier at night.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:53.700
Huh? I think I had something just now.

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.200
What did I just do?

00:08:57.450 --> 00:09:02.040
We use it all the time,
but we never think about how we do it.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.040
That's incredible.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.170
Sis Riku was so good at it.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:10.800
Riku-chan could even use the ones
besides the main body and Midori-chan's.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:14.630
But Riku-chan only cared
about the texture.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:18.260
She took away a fluffy one
that Rina was eating once.

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.600
-So mean.
-I remember that.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:22.850
She was like that.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:27.020
Was Riku-san like one of you?

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:28.190
My older sister.

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:32.480
Sis Riku had sharp senses
and really skilled hands.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.280
She was a great help finding water.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:40.030
Wow, all 5 of you sisters are incredible.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.120
You're all so strong too.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.700
But the strongest was...

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:51.340
Ryo-chan, I think.
She'd beat Red Bugs left and right.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:52.880
She was strong.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:55.670
Yes.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.060
-Yeah!
-Let's check and see!

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:15.900
Has it filled up?

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.200
It's not glowing yet.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.570
Guess we have to eat lots more.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.500
Are you all okay?

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:34.460
What are you panicking about?

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.340
We're duplicating with Momo-chan.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:39.380
Just like the First Person.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:45.100
So if you use that, you can duplicate
Rin-san and Ritsu-san too?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.060
Only Rina-chan could use that leaf.

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.060
The leaf is growing weak too.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.310
It's because we eat a lot.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.020
Eating is important.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:56.570
Rinamu still isn't getting up.

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.650
We need to make it glow more.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.280
We need to eat up!

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:02.700
You're so kind, Rina.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:07.200
You did that to cheer up
Rin-san and Ritsu-san, didn't you?

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.750
N-Not true!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.590
Be quiet, Wakaba!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:26.010
But Kemurikusa really is
an important tool for you all.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:34.730
What do you want? Get away from me.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.280
S-Sorry, I was just curious...

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:41.610
Your Kemurikusa is even prettier
at night too, Rin-san.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.950
-Why are you hiding?
-Shut up.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.790
She doesn't want to see you.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.460
You're poisonous. You're not tasty.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.170
Huh, what do you mean?

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:59.380
I just thought that if I learned more
about that Kemurikusa, I could help...

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.130
-Sleep.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.100
Is this...?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:22.700
I don't see any Red Bugs. Good.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.910
We have to cross this
to get to Island Four. Let's do this.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.990
-It's been so long.
-Off to the lake!

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:34.210
But how do we climb up there?

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.540
Like last time?

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:39.300
Yes, thank you, Rin.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.610
Oh wow...

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:03.530
Okay, climb on in.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.200
Rin, we're all ready.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:11.240
Huh? You don't mean...

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:13.870
Okay.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:39.480
Wow, this is amazing...but it's so scary!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:41.570
Don't worry.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:44.990
Rin is reliable. She won't drop us.

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:48.990
No...no...!

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.380
Good work, Rin. You must be tired.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.840
That was so scary...

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:08.050
I can't get up...

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:16.890
So this is Sky Bridge?

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:18.980
It's so high up.

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.270
This will lead us to Island Four.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:24.070
Why does Sky Bridge stop all of a sudden?

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.610
Maybe it was even longer in the past.

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.070
Maybe somebody ate it.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:32.910
The fog is thick on the bridge today.
I'll walk up front.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.160
Okay.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.170
This is so interesting.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.630
I wonder how the topography
turned out like this.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.380
Ryoku-chan used to say the same thing.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.230
I feel...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.280
Again?

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.820
At this height! Oh no!

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:21.120
It's over.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.380
Are you okay?

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.880
We're fine.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.500
I almost had a heart attack.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.140
Rin!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.700
Rin, are you okay?

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.740
Stand back! It's a huge one.

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:57.030
If that laser beam hits my sisters...

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:03.620
It's Nushi.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:18.720
Run!

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:36.570
Rin, get on!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.870
No, it'll catch up. I have to fight.

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:48.880
Now's our chance. This way!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.550
-It's...
-Hey!

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:01.270
I think it's going to stop again.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.480
What?

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.200
A Nushi on this bridge? Why?

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:24.620
-So that's...?
-I thought they were only at Island Six.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.540
Rin, is your arm okay?

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.630
I'm fine, the leaf is safe.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.590
It'll find us in no time. I have to fight.

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:38.050
Will you be okay, Sis Rin?

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.560
Can you beat Nushi in one blow?

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.850
I have to. You all run when you can.

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:45.600
We can't leave you.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:48.400
Anybody but me would die from that beam.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.980
You'd die too. It's way too strong.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.570
But we'd all be killed if we stay. Go!

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:54.990
Not even Ryo...

00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:59.780
May I put in a word?

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:03.330
I think it's reacting to Kemurikusa.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.620
What do you mean?

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:08.420
It seemed like it was aiming for
the ones I dropped.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.920
We might be able to use them as a decoy.

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.130
How?

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:16.470
Rina-san, I need your help.

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:18.050
Huh?

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:32.190
-Rina's exhausted.
-Yeah...

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:36.110
Thanks, Rina-san. That should be enough.

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:39.070
Rin, I'll signal you.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:41.120
-Be careful.
-Got it.

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:43.370
Thank you for doing this.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:55.210
-Rina-san.
-Gotcha. Ready?

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:08.680
You're right, it's reacting to it!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.020
Good. Okay, Rin-san.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:39.880
-Rina-san.
-Okay.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.150
You did it!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.950
-Wow, that was amazing!
-That's right.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.600
Rina, Sis, are you okay?

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:34.190
I'm so glad...you were all safe...

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:35.940
Wakaba, are you okay?

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:38.820
Seems okay. How did you do that?

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:44.280
I...I think one of these blocked it...

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.620
That was so scary...

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.910
-Rin-san...?
-I'm fine. Is Nushi dead?

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:03.920
We defeated a Nushi...?

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.720
All right!

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:09.970
-We beat Nushi!
-Sis Rin is the best!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:14.230
We can...beat Nushi...?

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:22.690
We did it on our own, Ryo...

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:29.950
You were right, Wakaba-kun.
How did you figure it out?

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.120
I just got lucky.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:36.120
Rin-san did all the dangerous stuff.

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.290
We're all safe. That's what counts.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:42.300
Another Red Bug might appear.
Let's hurry up and get across.

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.840
Hey, wait for me!

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:53.810
-Island Four!
-Yay!

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:05.780
We haven't explored all of Island Four,
so there might be water.

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:09.160
-You're right.
-I can't wait.

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:37.080
ADMINISTRATION　COLOR　DETECTED
